lang=EN-US>0≤<i>k</i>&lt;<i>n</i></span>），将其划分为两个不相交的子集<span lang=EN-US>A<sub>1</sub></span>和<span
lang=EN-US>A<sub>2</sub></span>，元素个数分别是<i><span lang=EN-US>n</span></i><sub><span
lang=EN-US>1</span></sub>和<i><span lang=EN-US>n</span></i><sub><span
lang=EN-US>2</span></sub>，<span lang=EN-US> A<sub>1</sub></span>和<span
lang=EN-US>A<sub>2</sub></span>中元素之和分别为<span lang=EN-US>S<sub>1</sub></span>和<span
lang=EN-US>S<sub>2</sub></span>。设计一个尽可能高效的划分算法，满足<span lang=EN-US>|<i>n</i><sub>1</sub>-<i>n</i><sub>2</sub>|</span>最小且<span
lang=EN-US>|S<sub>1</sub>-S<sub>2</sub>|</span>最大。要求：</span></b><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><b><span style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'>　　（<span lang=EN-US>1</span>）给出算法的基本设计思想。</span></b><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><b><span style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'>　　（<span lang=EN-US>2</span>）根据设计思想，采用<span lang=EN-US>C</span>、<span
lang=EN-US>C++</span>描述算法，关键之处给出注释。</span></b><span lang=EN-US
style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><b><span style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'>　　（<span lang=EN-US>3</span>）说明你所设计算法的时间复杂度和空间复杂度。</span></b><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><span style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'>答：<b>思路：采用快速排序的思想，取第一个数为枢轴，将<span lang=EN-US>A</span>分划成两部分。判断枢轴的位置与<i><span
lang=EN-US>n</span></i><span lang=EN-US>/2</span>的关系，也就是查找第<i><span lang=EN-US>n</span></i><span
lang=EN-US>/2</span>小的元素。如果枢轴的位置等于<span lang=EN-US>n/2</span>，则枢轴恰好将集合<span
lang=EN-US>A</span>划分成了元素个数基本相等的两部分，前一部分是由较小的数组成，而后一部分是由较大的数组成，即：将前</b></span><b><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%;font-family:Symbol;
mso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;mso-char-type:symbol;
mso-symbol-font-family:Symbol'><span style='mso-char-type:symbol;mso-symbol-font-family:
Symbol'>&euml;</span></span></b><b><i><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'>n</span></i></b><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'>/2</span></b><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%;font-family:Symbol;mso-ascii-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-font-family:
宋体;mso-char-type:symbol;mso-symbol-font-family:Symbol'><span style='mso-char-type:
symbol;mso-symbol-font-family:Symbol'>&ucirc;</span></span></b><span class=GramE><b><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'>个</span></b></span><b><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'>较小的元素放在<span lang=EN-US>A<sub>1</sub></span>中，其他放在<span
lang=EN-US>A<sub>2</sub></span>中。这样，<span lang=EN-US>A<sub>1</sub></span>与<span
lang=EN-US>A<sub>2</sub></span>的元素个数之差最小，而和之差最大，算法的时间复杂度为：<span class=GramE><span
lang=EN-US>O(</span></span><span lang=EN-US>n)</span></span></b><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'>.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><span style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'>算法伪代码如下：（可以考虑作为最后的算法设计题——采用算法填空的形式）<span lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><span class=SpellE><b><span lang=EN-US
style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'>int</span></b></span><b><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'> Partition(<span
class=SpellE>int</span> a[],<span class=SpellE>int</span> <span class=SpellE>low,int</span>
high) //</span></b><b><span style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'>以<span
lang=EN-US>a[low]</span>为基准进行划分</span></b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:
10.5pt;line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><span class=GramE><b><span lang=EN-US
style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'>{<span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span><span class=SpellE>int</span></span></b></span><b><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'> i=<span class=SpellE>low,j</span>=high;</span></b><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:
10.5pt;line-height:125%'><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
class=SpellE><span class=GramE>int</span></span> <span class=SpellE>povit</span>=a[low];</span></b><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:
10.5pt;line-height:125%'><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
class=GramE>while</span> (i&lt;j)</span></b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:
10.5pt;line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:
10.5pt;line-height:125%'><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span>{<span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span class=GramE>while</span>
(i&lt;j &amp;&amp; a[j]&gt;=<span class=SpellE>povit</span>)</span></b><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:
10.5pt;line-height:125%'><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span><span class=GramE>j--</span>;</span></b><span lang=EN-US
style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:
10.5pt;line-height:125%'><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
class=GramE>a[</span>i]=a[j];</span></b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:
10.5pt;line-height:125%'><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
class=GramE>while</span> (i&lt;j &amp;&amp; a[i]&lt;=<span class=SpellE>povit</span>)</span></b><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:
10.5pt;line-height:125%'><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span><span class=GramE>i</span>++;</span></b><span lang=EN-US
style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:
10.5pt;line-height:125%'><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
class=GramE>a[</span>j]=a[i];</span></b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:
10.5pt;line-height:125%'><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>}</span></b><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:
10.5pt;line-height:125%'><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
class=GramE>a[</span>i]=<span class=SpellE>povit</span>;</span></b><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:
10.5pt;line-height:125%'><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
class=GramE>return</span> i;</span></b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:
10.5pt;line-height:125%'>}</span></b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><span class=SpellE><b><span lang=EN-US
style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'>int</span></b></span><b><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'> Solution(<span
class=SpellE>int</span> a[],<span class=SpellE>int</span> n)<span
style='mso-tab-count:2'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>//</span></b><b><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'>求解</span></b><span lang=EN-US
style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><span class=GramE><b><span lang=EN-US
style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'>{<span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span><span class=SpellE>int</span></span></b></span><b><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'> low=0,high=n-1;</span></b><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:
10.5pt;line-height:125%'><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
class=SpellE><span class=GramE>bool</span></span> flag=true;</span></b><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:
10.5pt;line-height:125%'><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
class=GramE>while</span> (flag)</span></b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:
10.5pt;line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:
10.5pt;line-height:125%'><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
class=GramE>{<span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span><span class=SpellE>int</span></span>
i=Partition(<span class=SpellE>a,low,high</span>);</span></b><span lang=EN-US
style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:
10.5pt;line-height:125%'><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>if (i==n/2-1)<span
style='mso-tab-count:3'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>//</span></b><b><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'>基准<span lang=EN-US>a[i]</span>为第<span
lang=EN-US>n/2</span>的元素</span></b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:
10.5pt;line-height:125%'><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span><span class=GramE>flag=</span>false;</span></b><span lang=EN-US
style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:
10.5pt;line-height:125%'><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>else if
(n/2-1&gt;i)<span style='mso-tab-count:3'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>//</span></b><b><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'>在右区间查找</span></b><span lang=EN-US
style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:
10.5pt;line-height:125%'><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span><span class=GramE>low=</span>i+1;</span></b><span lang=EN-US
style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:
10.5pt;line-height:125%'><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
class=GramE>else</span></span></b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:
10.5pt;line-height:125%'><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span>high=i-1;<span style='mso-tab-count:3'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>//</span></b><b><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'>在左区间查找</span></b><span lang=EN-US
style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:
10.5pt;line-height:125%'><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>}</span></b><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:
10.5pt;line-height:125%'><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
class=SpellE><span class=GramE>int</span></span> s1=0,s2=0;</span></b><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:
10.5pt;line-height:125%'><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
class=GramE>for</span> (<span class=SpellE>int</span> i=0;i&lt;n/2;i++)</span></b><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:
10.5pt;line-height:125%'><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>s1+=a[i];</span></b><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:
10.5pt;line-height:125%'><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
class=GramE>for</span> (<span class=SpellE>int</span> j=n/2;j&lt;<span
class=SpellE>n;j</span>++)</span></b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:
10.5pt;line-height:125%'><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>s2+=a[j];</span></b><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:
10.5pt;line-height:125%'><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
class=GramE>return</span> s2-s1;</span></b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:
10.5pt;line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:
10.5pt;line-height:125%'>}</span></b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'>2.<b> </b></span><b><span style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:
125%'>流水作业调度问题为：有<i><span lang=EN-US>n</span></i><span class=GramE>个</span>作业（编号为<span
lang=EN-US>1</span>～<i><span lang=EN-US>n</span></i>）要在由两台机器<span lang=EN-US>M1</span>和<span
lang=EN-US>M2</span>组成的流水线上完成加工。每个作业加工的顺序都是先在<span lang=EN-US>M1</span>上加工，然后在<span
lang=EN-US>M2</span>上加工。<span lang=EN-US>M1</span>和<span lang=EN-US>M2</span>加工作业<i><span
lang=EN-US>i</span></i>所需的时间分别为<span class=SpellE><i><span lang=EN-US>a<sub>i</sub></span></i></span>和<span
class=SpellE><i><span lang=EN-US>b<sub>i</sub></span></i></span>（<span
lang=EN-US>1≤<i>i</i>≤<i>n</i></span>）。流水作业调度问题要求确定这<i><span lang=EN-US>n</span></i><span
class=GramE>个</span>作业的最优加工顺序，使得从第一个作业在机器<span lang=EN-US>M1</span>上开始加工，到最后一个作业在机器<span
lang=EN-US>M2</span>上加工完成所需的时间最少。可以假定任何作业一旦开始加工，就不允许被中断，直到该作业被完成。请简述贪心算法求解流水作业调度问题的步骤。<span
lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><b><span style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'>答：（<span lang=EN-US>1</span>）把所有<span class=GramE>作业按</span><span
lang=EN-US>M1</span>、<span lang=EN-US>M2</span>的时间分为两组，<i><span lang=EN-US>a</span></i><span
lang=EN-US>[<i>i</i>]≤<i>b</i>[<i>i</i>]</span>对应第<span lang=EN-US>1</span>组<span
lang=EN-US>N1</span>，<i><span lang=EN-US>a</span></i><span lang=EN-US>[<i>i</i>]&gt;<i>b</i>[<i>i</i>]</span>对应第<span
lang=EN-US>0</span>组<span lang=EN-US>N2</span>。</span></b><span lang=EN-US
style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-indent:21.0pt;line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:
char;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><b><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'>（<span lang=EN-US>2</span>）将<span
lang=EN-US>N1</span>组的<span class=GramE>作业按</span>第一道工序<i><span lang=EN-US>a</span></i><span
lang=EN-US>[<i>i</i>]</span>递增排序，<span lang=EN-US>N2</span>组的<span class=GramE>作业按</span>第<span
lang=EN-US>2</span>道工序<i><span lang=EN-US>b</span></i><span lang=EN-US>[<i>i</i>]</span>递减排序。</span></b><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-indent:21.0pt;line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:
char;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><b><span
style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'>（<span lang=EN-US>3</span>）按顺序先执行<span
lang=EN-US>N1</span>的作业，再执行<span lang=EN-US>N2</span>的作业，得到的就是耗时最少的最优调度方案。</span></b><span
lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'>3. </span><b><span style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'>线性表<span
lang=EN-US>(<i>a</i><sub>1</sub>,<i>a</i><sub>2</sub>,…,<i>a<sub>n</sub></i>) </span>中的元素<span
lang=EN-US>(</span>整数<span lang=EN-US>)</span>按值递增顺序存储。要求用最少时间在表中查找其值为<span
lang=EN-US>x</span>的元素。若找到，则将其与后继元素位置互换；若找不到，则将其插入表中，并使得表中元素仍然递增有序。<span
lang=EN-US><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><span style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'>算法伪代码如下：（可以考虑作为最后的算法设计题——采用算法填空的形式）<span lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><span class=GramE><span lang=EN-US
style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'>void</span></span><span lang=EN-US
style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'> <span class=SpellE>LocatInsert</span>(
<span class=SpellE>SqList</span> &amp;L, <span class=SpellE>int</span> x ){<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'><span style='mso-tab-count:1'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
class=SpellE><span class=GramE>int</span></span><span class=GramE><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span>low</span>=0, high=L.length-1, mid;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'><span style='mso-tab-count:1'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
class=GramE>while(</span> low &lt;= high ){<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'><span style='mso-tab-count:2'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
class=GramE>mid</span> = ( low + high)/2;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'><span style='mso-tab-count:2'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
class=GramE>if(</span> <span class=SpellE>L.elem</span>[mid] == x ) break;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'><span style='mso-tab-count:2'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
class=GramE>else</span> if( <span class=SpellE>L.elem</span>[mid] &lt; x )<span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'><span style='mso-tab-count:3'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;</span><span class=GramE>low</span> = mid +1;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'><span style='mso-tab-count:2'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
class=GramE>else</span> high = mid-1;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'><span style='mso-tab-count:1'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>}<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-indent:21.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;
line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:
ideograph-numeric'><span class=GramE><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'>if(</span></span><span class=SpellE><span lang=EN-US
style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'>L.elem</span></span><span lang=EN-US
style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'>[mid]==x &amp;&amp; mid !=
L.length-1){<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'><span style='mso-tab-count:1'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span><span class=GramE>temp=</span><span
class=SpellE>L.elem</span>[mid]; <span style='mso-tab-count:1'>&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
class=SpellE>L.elem</span>[mid]=<span class=SpellE>L.elem</span>[mid+1]; <span
style='mso-tab-count:1'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span class=SpellE>L.elem</span>[mid+1]=temp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-indent:21.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;
line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:
ideograph-numeric'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'>}<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-indent:21.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;
line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:
ideograph-numeric'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'>If
<span class=GramE>( low</span>&gt;high){<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'><span style='mso-tab-count:1'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span><span class=GramE>for(</span>i=L.length-1;i&gt;high;
i--)<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'><span style='mso-tab-count:2'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span><span class=SpellE><span class=GramE>L.elem</span></span><span
class=GramE>[</span>i+1]=<span class=SpellE>L.elem</span>[i];<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'><span style='mso-tab-count:1'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp; </span><span class=SpellE><span class=GramE>L.elem</span></span><span
class=GramE>[</span>i+1]=x;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-indent:21.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;
line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:
ideograph-numeric'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%'>}<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'>}<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'>4.</span><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:20.0pt;
line-height:125%;font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";mso-fareast-font-family:
宋体;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;color:red;
mso-font-kerning:12.0pt'> </span></b><b><span style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'>设计一个尽可能快速的算法，从非空有序顺序表中删除所有其值重复的元素，使表中元素的值各不相同。<span
lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><span style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'>算法伪代码如下：（可以考虑作为最后的算法设计题——采用算法填空的形式）<span lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:
10.5pt;line-height:125%'><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>void&nbsp;<span
class=SpellE>DelSameElem</span>(<span class=SpellE>SqList</span>&nbsp;&amp;L){<br>
<span style='mso-tab-count:1'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
class=SpellE>int</span>&nbsp;<span class=SpellE>i,k</span>;<br>
<span style='mso-tab-count:1'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>k=1;<br>
<span style='mso-tab-count:1'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>for(i=1;i&lt;<span
class=SpellE>L.length;i</span>++){<br>
<span style='mso-tab-count:2'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>if(<span
class=SpellE>L.elem</span>[i-1]!=<span class=SpellE>L.elem</span>[i]){ <br>
<span style='mso-tab-count:2'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span
class=SpellE>L.elem</span>[k]=<span class=SpellE>L.elem</span>[i];<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:
10.5pt;line-height:125%'><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;</span>k++;<br>
<span style='mso-tab-count:2'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>}<br>
<span style='mso-tab-count:1'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>}<br>
<span style='mso-tab-count:1'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
class=SpellE>L.length</span>=k+1;<br>
<span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>}<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='line-height:125%;layout-grid-mode:char;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.5pt;
line-height:125%'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

